  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Fleet Vehicle Source reported $447M in contract obligations for FY2026 to date. Fleet Vehicle Source recorded 14,915 awards and an average award size of $30K. Fleet Vehicle Source obligations are up 14.3% year over year. Fleet Vehicle Source obligations by fiscal year show a multi-year pattern: FY21 $182M, FY22 $232M, FY23 $474M, FY24 $256M, FY25 $391M, FY26 $447M. Fleet Vehicle Source current-year totals are partial, covering fiscal year to date, and obligations reflect contract-level payments rather than award-value totals for some tables. Fleet Vehicle Source award counts and average award size indicate a high volume of relatively small awards. Fleet Vehicle Source fiscal history shows FY23 with the largest recorded obligations at $474M and a lower midpoint in FY24 at $256M. Fleet Vehicle Source year-over-year growth of up 14.3% positions the vendor above its immediate prior-year pace in the current fiscal year to date.",
    "sections": [
      {
        "heading": "How have obligations trended by fiscal year?",
        "body": "Fleet Vehicle Source obligations rose from $182M in FY21 to $232M in FY22 and peaked at $474M in FY23. Fleet Vehicle Source obligations then fell to $256M in FY24 before climbing to $391M in FY25 and reaching $447M in FY26. Fleet Vehicle Source exhibits multi-year variability with FY23 as the highest-obligation year on record."
      },
      {
        "heading": "What does the FY2026 to date total mean for contractors?",
        "body": "Fleet Vehicle Source FY2026 to date obligations equal $447M, and those totals are partial for the fiscal year to date. Fleet Vehicle Source average award size of $30K and an award count of 14,915 show the vendor receives many comparatively small awards. Fleet Vehicle Source obligations are up 14.3% year over year, reflecting higher obligations so far in the current fiscal year."
      }
    ]
